{
  "name": "Call new form leads within seconds with a ContactShip AI agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Call new leads within seconds\n\nWhen your form or landing page sends a lead to this webhook, a ContactShip AI voice agent calls the lead right away.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Add your ContactShip credential (API key from **Organization → API Keys**).\n2. In **Call Lead**, pick the **Agent** and the **From Number**.\n3. Send your form submissions as JSON to the **Production URL** of **New Lead** with `name`, `phone` (international format, e.g. +12125551234), `email` and `interest`.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\nTo receive the call result, add a **ContactShip Trigger** workflow and paste its Production URL in **Webhook URL**.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "616f3b87-8ad9-57d2-b672-eb18e1e7f00b",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "contactship-new-lead",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "84fa85e7-8826-5311-81a1-ba149ae930a6",
      "name": "New Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "f496a246-66c9-5471-be35-893f4cde3315"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "call",
        "operation": "makeCall",
        "agentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "fromNumber": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "toNumber": "={{ $json.body.phone }}",
        "fullName": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "email": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
          "variables": {
            "variable": [
              {
                "key": "interest",
                "value": "={{ $json.body.interest }}"
              },
              {
                "key": "lead_source",
                "value": "web form"
              }
            ]
          },
          "metadata": "={{ JSON.stringify({ source: 'n8n-form', received_at: $now.toISO() }) }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "d93a89f0-e919-5633-baa6-6a6a68bf6fce",
      "name": "Call Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-contactship.contactShip",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
